---
name: rerank-monotonic-gate
severity: error
on:
  - edit
where:
  - "docs/proofs/agentpm/**/*.json"
  - "ci/guards/**"
then:
  - run: make -s guards.rerank.order
    message: "Rerank results must be sorted non-increasing by score."
---
Reranker outputs must be sorted by score (non-increasing). Any violation fails closed.